    value: <style=coinColor><size=32><b>{0:CommaNumber}</b></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_ANY_BAR
    value: <size=24>Any Bar
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: <size=24>Appears on reel 2 only.
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_M7
    value: <size=24>Mixed 7s Pay
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_MB
    value: <size=24>Mixed Bars Pay
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2
    value: <style=title><size=42>ARE YOU A CAT OR DOG?
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_MODE
    value: '<size=32><b>CAT MODE</b>

      <size=22>- Cat character on the couch means you''re on <color=#FBA02FFF>team
      Cat!</color>

      - Receive a bonus for consecutive           appearing on reel 3 on the center
      payline.

      - Bonus amount keeps increasing, to a maximum 20x, for consecutive            received.

      - Switch to <color=#66B3DFFF>team Dog</color> when           appears. Bonus
      amount is re-set.


      <size=32><b>DOG MODE</b>

      <size=22>- Dog character on the couch means you''re on <color=#66B3DFFF>team
      Dog!</color>

      - Receive a bonus for consecutive           appearing on reel 3 on the center
      payline.

      - Bonus amount keeps increasing, to a maximum 20x, for consecutive           received.

      - Switch to <color=#FBA02FFF>team Cat</color> when           appears. Bonus
      amount is re-set.

'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=42>PAW WARS PARTY BONUS
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_ENTER
    value: '<size=32><b>ENTER THE BONUS</b>

      <size=22>- Each           earns <b>Paw Points</b> and increases the <b>Paw Wars
      Bonus Meter.</b>

      - Higher the bet level, higher the awarded Paw Points.

      - All players in the game room contribute to the bonus meter together.

      - When meter is full, begin Paw Wars as a           or         .'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAW_WARS
    value: "<size=32><b>PAW WARS</b>\n<size=22>- Upon bonus, receive a random number
      of battle rounds.\n- In each round, winner from laser gun draw collects a multiplier
      from briefcases.\n- Briefcase Award Types:\n       - <b>Multiplier:</b> Receive
      a multiplier.\n       -  <b>Steal:</b> Randomly steal an opponent's multiplier.\n
      \      -  <b>Next Stage:</b> Both teams move to next stage with increased multipliers.
      \n           There are 6 stages total.\n<size=10>\n<size=32><b>WINNER'S BONUS</b>\n<size=22>-
      \         or         with more multipliers in the end receives a winner's bonus
      of 20x!\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Paw Wars
